    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Madcap Meks",
    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), roll one D6 when a single enemy takes all the ranged targeting from a friendly **MORKANAUT**, **WAZBOM BLASTAJET**, **BIG MEK** or **MEK GUNZ** unit. On 1, **Dat’s Weird** gives the target 4+ **[InSv](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls)**. On 2–3, For **Hop Splat**, pick a different enemy within 3\" of that target. Deal D3 **[Mortal Wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** to the chosen unit. On 4, **Seekerz** gives those attacks +1 on **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)**. On 5, **Lifted** gives the target **FLY** and strips its **[Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**. On 6, **Runtified** gives the target −1 **T**. Results 1, 5 and 6 last until the firing unit finishes shooting.",
